        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Power up your leg day with Fit Fight XR: Squat Strike! This immersive MR/VR roguelite fitness game transforms every squat, lunge, and hop into powerful attacks against epic enemies. Experience a full-throttle leg workout that's as fun as it is effective. Track your progress, earn rewards, and stay motivated as you level up your fitness journey. Fit Fight XR: Squat Strike turns exercise into an exciting adventure!\n🦵 Leg-Focused Workouts: Squats, lunges, hops, and more to strengthen and tone your legs.\n🎮 Gamified Fitness Combat: Engage in dynamic battles where your exercises transform into powerful attacks against enemies.\n✨ Unique Upgrades: Unlock different attacks each game, ensuring no two workouts are the same.\n📈 Progress Tracking: Monitor stats, and watch your fitness improve.\n🆕 Regular Updates: Fresh challenges and enemies added frequently to keep workouts exciting.\n😎 MR & VR Modes: Choose between Mixed Reality and Virtual Reality for immersive gameplay.\n🎵 Energetic Soundtrack: Pumping music to keep you moving and motivated.",
